            "text": "theorem hasDerivAt_lg2' {u : ℝ} (hu : 0 < u) : HasDerivAt lg2' (lg2'' u) u := by\n  convert ((Real.hasDerivAt_log hu.ne').const_mul (-8)).div (hasDerivAt_id u) hu.ne' using 1\n  · ext v; simp [lg2']\n  · simp only [lg2'', id]; field_simp; ring",
